# Atlas, Ocean Gladiator

> Atlas is a roamer for teams that can turn one clean grab into a fight win. Patch 2.1.95a ([patch notes](/patch-notes)) trimmed Perfect Match's speed bonus and stretched its cooldown, so his roam-to-gank window is slower and his chase is less free than before. The pick still collapses if the enemy draft has purify, suppression, or too many instant exits.

