- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn damage that chips Atlas before Perfect Match starts.; Blade Armor over Antique Cuirass when Use when a basic-attack marksman is forced to hit Atlas during the Fatal Links channel.; Guardian Helmet over Fleeting Time when Use when you are winning vision but entering every objective fight too low to start cleanly.
